{"title":"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solutions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/7/ef7fe7592026585cc36e4d7c6036f19fd8afdc29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5\\times 5$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> grid shown contains a collection of squares with sizes from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/8/8a8df7312744a199daa5c8008af5b9b4798bfd64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\times 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"39\" height=\"12\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/7/ef7fe7592026585cc36e4d7c6036f19fd8afdc29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5\\times 5$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />. How many of these squares contain the black center square?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/2/f12ad733cea58225fdba60c1c7867a76f3b29e80.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] for (int i=0; i&lt;5; ++i) {  for (int j=0; j&lt;5; ++j) {    draw((-2.5+i, -2.5+j)--(-1.5+i, -2.5+j) -- (-1.5+i, -1.5+j) -- (-2.5+i, -1.5+j)--cycle);  }  fill((-0.5,-0.5)--(-0.5, 0.5)--(0.5,0.5) -- (0.5,-0.5)--cycle, black); } [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/4/1d4eaf220bb5908f25aff55f0a053c5f37d09fc8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } 12 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } 15 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 17 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ }  19\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"387\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Since there are five types of squares: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/3/2639894eb5f648d7dd73dd709611209eb4b1939e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\times 1, 2 \\times 2, 3 \\times 3, 4 \\times 4,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"190\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/a/ddaf84125c1b24d65a28e3a6fa187dab22b17521.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\times 5.$\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" /> We must find how many of each square contain the black shaded square in the center. \n</p><p>If we list them, we get that \n</p>\n<ul><li>There is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> of all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/8/8a8df7312744a199daa5c8008af5b9b4798bfd64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\times 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"39\" height=\"12\" /> squares, containing the black square</li>\n<li>There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> of all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/7901356dd65ec4da1b694937cc4ffc663e90d800.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\times 2$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> squares, containing the black square</li>\n<li>There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> of all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/5/7b5343f2d9e22816e8de24262565ff2937695b2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\times 3$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> squares, containing the black square</li>\n<li>There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> of all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/4/674dc6717f1938acff63480bd24b1270a30439ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\times 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> squares, containing the black square</li>\n<li>There is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> of all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/7/ef7fe7592026585cc36e4d7c6036f19fd8afdc29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5\\times 5$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> squares, containing the black square</li></ul>\n<p>Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/d/8cd560743d8d5d395baabfca641849dce3332f76.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+4+9+4+1=19\\Rightarrow\\boxed{\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 19}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"268\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>We use complementary counting. There are only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/3/8a3b32228e9105bf0f3dffd78b0b7310083b693d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\times2$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41cc793e4f6d8149b881fa5ac0843dea8f309f24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\times1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"39\" height=\"12\" /> squares that do not contain the black square. Counting, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />-<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/3/8a3b32228e9105bf0f3dffd78b0b7310083b693d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\times2$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> squares, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/d/10d5fc1af8dbefb4e206138240c04731cb23e582.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25-1 = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41cc793e4f6d8149b881fa5ac0843dea8f309f24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\times1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"39\" height=\"12\" /> squares that do not contain the black square. That gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/f/e3f67f2143ff7db50b15d6196ea16decff4589a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12+24=36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"100\" height=\"14\" /> squares that don't contain it. There are a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/b/88b1c3e69e5fa9a70eb02987237c753594b2d509.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25+16+9+4+1 = 55$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"194\" height=\"14\" /> squares possible <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/4/d3461aa9f087c5f02d0acd161cb8514a6db74087.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"24\" height=\"18\" /> - <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41cc793e4f6d8149b881fa5ac0843dea8f309f24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\times1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"39\" height=\"12\" /> squares <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> - <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/3/8a3b32228e9105bf0f3dffd78b0b7310083b693d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\times2$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> squares <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> - <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/d/77d7104f34af16053b63ce7cfa87265d915c6105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\times3$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> squares <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> - <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/0/b104e8c71a3698d4c073f00681bc1bf6412754fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\times4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> squares and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> - <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/f/dbf62794748fc97d1bfe454296f10da375126bac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5\\times5$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> square), therefore there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/8/2482748a99a787b95876fc66d8ccc5b2479f1c27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$55-36 = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"100\" height=\"13\" /> squares that contain the black square, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/9/fd9e8916434c4a10a57f03e3cf2f969d8c7e8de8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 19}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"63\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/HhdpuJt78Hg?t=168\">https://youtu.be/HhdpuJt78Hg?t=168</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n~VictorZhang\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solutions\">Video Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/0W3VmFp55cM?t=4697\">https://youtu.be/0W3VmFp55cM?t=4697</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/aMmF6jz6xA4\">https://youtu.be/aMmF6jz6xA4</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A\">2004 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_17\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_14\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_17\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_18\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_22\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_23\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_24\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_25\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_10_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 10 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 10 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017190217\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 298/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2324/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 158/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6824/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.762      1 -total\n 60.74%    7.752      1 Template:AMC10_box\n 38.26%    4.883      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:6337:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017190217 and revision id 224986. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}